sub:assertion {
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch08-16> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch08-16--grok> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch08-16--grok> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 on thompson1917-ch08-16: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.59" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.593"^^xsd:double ;
    delphi:hasVerdict "partially-resolvable" ;
    delphi:hasConfidence "0.55"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:description "The shape-to-plane mapping is measurable and overlaps rules that public embryo and meristem volumes were built to study. Those volumes are the wrong taxa for the apical cells named in the claim, so they test a proxy. The growth-rate clause adds little beyond the shape already observed, which caps how decisive a confirmation can be." ;
    rdfs:comment "Proposed test with existing data: Record cell shape immediately before division and the plane that is used: transverse in markedly oblong cells, oblique when the cell is a little more than a hemisphere, and longitudinal when it is less than a hemisphere. That mapping, in cells whose shape was set by the growth-to-division interval, would support the claim; planes uncorrelated with those shape classes would refute it." ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> ;
    delphi:evidenceAgainst "Shape is partly defined by the growth-to-division ratio, so that half of the wording is close to a description of the cell that is about to divide.", "The three-way rule was stated for moss, liverwort, fern and algal apical cells, which these Arabidopsis volumes only approximate." ;
    delphi:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch08-16--grok--dataset-1>, <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/thompson1917-ch08-16--grok--dataset-2> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch08-16--grok--operationalizability> a delphi:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Operationalizability of thompson1917-ch08-16 by Grok 4.7: 0.8" ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0-operationalizability> ;
    delphi:assessmentType "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0/operationalizability" ;
    delphi:hasScore "0.8"^^xsd:double ;
    dct:isPartOf <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch08-16--grok> ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-grok-4.7-high-fast> .
  <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/thompson1917-ch08-16> delphi:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/thompson1917-ch08-16--grok--operationalizability> .
